<h1 class="nm-h1" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;line-height:34px;font-weight:600;color:#1B2B4B;">
  Your verification code
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;">Enter this code to continue signing in.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin:0 0 20px;">
  <tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#FAF5E4" style="border:1px solid #E2CC7E;border-radius:10px;padding:22px 16px;">
    <span style="font-size:34px;line-height:40px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:10px;color:#1B2B4B;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;">{{code}}</span>
  </td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;color:#4B5563;">
  This code expires in {{expiryMinutes}} {{plural expiryMinutes "minute" "minutes"}}. It only works once.
</p>
<p style="margin:0;padding:14px 16px;background-color:#F5F3EE;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#6B7280;">
  <strong style="color:#1A1C20;">Didn't request this?</strong> Someone may have typed your address by
  mistake. You can ignore this email — nothing changes unless the code is entered.
  Nenjam Matrimony staff will never ask you for it.
</p>
